1..8
ok 1 - Type constraint - odd number
ok 2 - Type constraint - even number
ok 3 - Comb for <alpha> and join on |
ok 4 - Comb for <alpha>+ and join on |
ok 5 - Comb ASCII hex chars with hyperop to convert to ASCII equivalent
ok 6 - Comb ASCII hex chars using map to convert to ASCII equivalent
ok 7 - Caesar Cipher using .comb and .map
ok 8 - Caesar Cipher using parameter defaults
